WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.237
Spring, summer, fall, and winter are the four seasons.

2
00:00:10.238 --> 00:00:15.917
The seasons are different and they have special friends.

3
00:00:15.918 --> 00:00:19.312
Spring said, "I'm warm.

4
00:00:19.313 --> 00:00:25.102
Plants love me because I give them rain."

5
00:00:25.103 --> 00:00:30.231
Drip drop, drip drop.

6
00:00:30.232 --> 00:00:39.468
Spring said, "The butterflies love me because I give them flowers."

7
00:00:39.469 --> 00:00:44.612
Red flowers, yellow flowers.

8
00:00:44.613 --> 00:00:47.955
Summer said, "I'm very hot.

9
00:00:47.956 --> 00:00:55.122
The sea loves me because people swim in the sea."

10
00:00:55.123 --> 00:01:01.200
Splish splash, splish splash.

11
00:01:01.201 --> 00:01:08.369
Summer said, "Ice cream loves me because people eat ice cream."

12
00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:17.785
Strawberry flavor, vanilla flavor.

13
00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:20.902
Fall said, "I'm cool.

14
00:01:20.903 --> 00:01:27.856
The leaves love me because I give them pretty colors."

15
00:01:27.857 --> 00:01:33.175
Red, orange, and yellow.

16
00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:39.452
Fall said, "The squirrels love me because I give them nuts."

17
00:01:39.453 --> 00:01:43.842
Pick up, pick up.

18
00:01:43.843 --> 00:01:47.401
Winter said, "I'm very cold.

19
00:01:47.402 --> 00:01:55.643
The snow loves me because children play in the snow."

20
00:01:55.644 --> 00:02:00.601
Snowflakes, snowflakes.

21
00:02:00.602 --> 00:02:08.692
Winter said, "The sleds love me because children go sledding."

22
00:02:08.693 --> 00:02:15.058
Weee! Weee!

23
00:02:15.059 --> 00:02:24.466
Spring, summer, fall, and winter are happy seasons.

24
00:02:24.467 --> 00:02:33.808
They are happy because they have special friends.

